    <preface>
      <p>Treasury Laws Amendment (2017 Measures No. 3) Act 2017</p>
      <p>No. 75, 2017</p>
      <p>An Act to amend the <i>Australian Securities and Investments Commission Act 2001</i> and the <i>Corporations Act 2001</i>, and for related purposes</p>
      <p>Contents</p>
      <p>1	Short title	1</p>
